<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Exposes highp_dvec1, mediump_dvec1 and lowp_dvec1 types.</para>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_vector__double1__precision_8hpp">glm/ext/vector_double1_precision.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>See also</title>

<para><link linkend="_group__ext__vector__double1">GLM_EXT_vector_double1</link></para>
</formalpara>
</para>
</section>
